            <trans-unit id="iIWC3BD">
                <source>description.guided_project_card_back</source>
                <target>Create a variant of a pack's card back, which players can win or buy, then choose, and put it on sale if you wish.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="uTfo64l">
                <source>description.guided_project_card_export</source>
                <target>Produce the cards' PDFs, images and videos from the dashboard tile: only what changed since the last export is made again.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="1lnvqC.">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_done</source>
                <target>The back is ready: a reward, a purchase or a code gives it by its slug.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="zWKy_oI">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_effect</source>
                <target>How the back moves: a slow zoom, stars… Refused when drawn on the same layer as the tone.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="JB9Dqrj">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_image</source>
                <target>Card-sized, in portrait. Without one, the back takes the pack's picture.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="oUvgEpU">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_name</source>
                <target>Its own name, the pack's being on the back already. The slug is drawn from it.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="ZMGIO0U">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_new</source>
                <target>A new variant for a pack's cards.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="HJJbJh0">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_open</source>
                <target>The list of variants, pack by pack.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="yRCr_AU">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_pack</source>
                <target>The cards of this pack will wear this back once the player chooses it.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="42Qz7Vk">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_price</source>
                <target>The same price on the site and in the app, €1.00 or €2.00 for instance. VAT included, its rate just below (0 when exempt). Leave it empty for a back that is only given, won in a quest or by a code.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fKPkQe5">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_published</source>
                <target>Only a published back can be given and chosen.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="U2U4GGg">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_back_tone</source>
                <target>The light laid over the picture. An effect drawn on the same layer is refused.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="BFeTy4P">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_export_follow</source>
                <target>Reload the dashboard: the tile shows the current step, the failure and its message, or the date of the last export. For a single series, the card:export command in a terminal does the same job.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="0C_qfFQ">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_export_open</source>
                <target>The export tile sits among the dashboard shortcuts, on the machine where Chrome and Ghostscript are installed.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="gGRXzN8">
                <source>description.guided_step_card_export_run</source>
                <target>Click the tile: the export goes to the Messenger worker and you get the hand back at once.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="3DW3sx7">
                <source>flash.export_running</source>
                <target>An export is already running or waiting. Nothing new was started.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="qZXs66x">
                <source>flash.export_started</source>
                <target>Export started: only what changed since the last one is redone. Reload the page to follow the tile.</target>
            </trans-unit>
